A PyNotes plugin to check your spelling in normal HMode editors. You can add new dictionaries and words at any time by putting a plain text wordlist in ~/.local/share/PyNotes/add-ons/Simple Spellcheck/Dictionaries. Turn on or off with the Alt-X and PyCode command 'spellcheck'.
==========
A simple typing test plugin which gives feedback in words in the end.
