This is a plugin which makes a full simple web browser buffer inside PyNotes, using playwright to drive the Chromium engine. Native easytk (ttkbootstrap) is used for the chrome of the browser, while websites are rendered in a tkinter canvas inside each tab. The browser currently has:
* tabs
* back/forward/reload/go buttons
* address bar
* clipboard integration with pynotes
* local files opened with normal file://... urls.
* native browser dropdown menus rendered by native easytk (ttkbootstrap)
* www.google.com opening on every new tab.
Not currently supported:
* audio
* file upload/download
* settings
* persistent cache
